         CH-BLK-STATES CH-BLK-ARRAYS
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-CASE
     STRING "contract wire provider " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-NAME) " decodes to the stated fields"
         DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-CASE
