     CALL "PB-RESET" USING PK-BUFFER
     CALL "PB-PUT-UBYTE" USING PK-BUFFER WS-PACKET-ID
     CALL "PB-PUT-OPEN-SCREEN" USING PK-BUFFER WS-CONTAINER WS-MENU PB-TEXT
